<title>USA: La Teko Resources names president, CEO.</title>
<headline>La Teko Resources names president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>La Teko Resources Ltd said Wednesday that Gerald Carlson has been appointed president and chief executive, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Robert Gentry, who was appointed president and chief executive in March, will remain as a company board member, the company said.</p>
